WEBVTT

00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:30.976
as things stand now,

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:36.643
their life prospects are likely
to be affected by this union.

00:08:36.667 --> 00:08:38.976
And you realize that you do know,

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:43.393
you do understand
that people will judge them.

00:08:43.417 --> 00:08:45.434
And in a hundred ways,

00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:48.934
those judgments will impact their lives

00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:51.125
and the lives of their children.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.059
At that moment,

00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:58.059
you are connecting with a powerful truth.

00:08:58.083 --> 00:09:03.583
Which is that you know
systemic racism is real.